    "bbox": [
      57.12,
      468.96,
      548.17,
      491.51
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall be valid for a period of 06 months commencing from May 09, 2018 subject to provisions of Sub Section (3)of section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
